Hi {!Case.Contact},

I'm sorry about your experience with those leads that you received. Let me walk you through the steps to return leads on your EverQuote Pro account.

1. On the 'Leads' tab, click the blue circle to the right of the lead you're looking to return. 
2. Click on the orange "Actions" tab that has appeared below the blue circle. 
3. Scroll down to 'Return Lead' on the drop down menu. 
4. Pick one of the 5 reason codes provided and provide a brief additional explanation in the box provided.
5. Click the orange "Return" button in the bottom-right corner of the box.

All returns are processed on Sunday nights, so you can review these every Monday morning.

All the best,